                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9fc58358-9291-3d2c-b51d-7a90dbdadccc",
                        "entry_id": "91adb49d-df04-3cea-a0ae-e267dddf2935",
                        "glosses": [
                            "канифас (A kind of sailcloth)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "relational"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ec26f441-4877-408e-9872-f83294b09399",
                                "sense_id": "9fc58358-9291-3d2c-b51d-7a90dbdadccc",
                                "text": "Да ещё, когда́ бри́чка подъе́хала к гости́нице, встре́тился молодо́й челове́к в бе́лых канифа́совых пантало́нах, весьма́ у́зких и коро́тких, во фра́ке с покуше́ньями на мо́ду, из-под кото́рого видна́ была́ мани́шка, застёгнутая ту́льскою була́вкою с бро́нзовым пистоле́том.",
                                "translation": "Moreover, just as the chaise drove up to the hotel it was met by a young man in extremely short and narrow white canvas trousers, in a coat with fashionable cut-away tails and a shirt-front fastened with a Tula breastpin adorned with a bronze pistol.",
                                "english": "Moreover, just as the chaise drove up to the hotel it was met by a young man in extremely short and narrow white canvas trousers, in a coat with fashionable cut-away tails and a shirt-front fastened with a Tula breastpin adorned with a bronze pistol."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
